@startuml

title provider settings API key save sequence

' Source of truth:
' - docs/detail-specs/ai-provider-settings-management.md
' - frontend/src/application/usecase/provider-settings/provider-settings.usecase.ts
' - frontend/src/controller/wails/provider-settings.gateway.ts
' - internal/controller/wails/provider_settings_controller.go
' - internal/usecase/provider_settings_usecase.go
' - internal/service/provider_settings_service.go
' - internal/repository/provider_settings_repository.go
' - internal/repository/provider_settings_keyring_secret_store.go

hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 18
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

participant "Frontend\nGateway" as Frontend
participant "Wails\nController" as WailsController
participant "Backend\nUseCase" as BackendUsecase
participant "ProviderSettings\nService" as Service
participant "SQLite\nrepository" as SQLiteRepository
participant "SecretStore\nport" as SecretStore
collections "OS\nkeyring" as OSKeyring

Frontend -> WailsController : SaveProviderSettings\n(providerId, endpoint, credentialInput)

WailsController -> BackendUsecase : SaveProviderSettingsWithSecret(saveRequest, apiKey)
BackendUsecase -> Service : SaveProviderSettings(input with APIKey)

activate Service
Service -> Service : providerSettingsSpec(providerID)
Service -> Service : withProviderSettingsMutationLock(providerID)
Service -> SQLiteRepository : GetByProviderID(providerID)
SQLiteRepository --> Service : current row or not found
Service -> Service : resolveSecretSavePlan()
note right of Service
  credentialReferenceID は provider-settings:<provider>。
  credentialState は configured。
  APIキー平文は service 内の一時値に閉じる。
end note

Service -> SQLiteRepository : Upsert(provider settings row)
note right of SQLiteRepository
  row には endpoint、credentialReferenceID、
  credentialState、requestToken を保存する。
  APIキー平文は保存しない。
end note
SQLiteRepository --> Service : saved row

Service -> SecretStore : Save(provider-settings:<provider>, apiKey)
SecretStore -> OSKeyring : Set(provider-settings:<provider>, data)
OSKeyring --> SecretStore : ok
SecretStore --> Service : ok

Service -> Service : buildSummary(saved row)
Service --> BackendUsecase : ProviderSettingsSummary\nwithout secret value
deactivate Service

BackendUsecase --> WailsController : SaveProviderSettingsResult
WailsController --> Gateway : response with credentialState and credentialReferenceId
Gateway --> FrontendUsecase : saved provider summary
FrontendUsecase -> Page : close API key panel and clear notice state
ScreenController -> ScreenController : clearCredentialInput()

alt secret save failed
    Service -> SQLiteRepository : restoreProviderSettingsRecord(previous row)
    Service --> BackendUsecase : redacted error
end

@enduml
